1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,760
I read once that two souls never meet by accident.

2
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:09,760
There's always a reason, a connection, that transcends time and distance.

3
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:17,000
Whether it's fate or destiny, if two people are meant to meet, nothing can stop it.

4
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:24,860
Their meeting is part of something greater than themselves, and it unfolds at exactly

5
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:25,700
the right time.
